WEBVTT

NOTE
The Lunar Gate launch — the capsule is fired toward the moon.
Duration: approximately 20 seconds.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.900
A capsule slides down the Lunar Gate's launch tube.

00:00:09.930 --> 00:00:13.830
The screen whites out in the blaze of launch.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:18.350
The view settles on the facility beneath an enormous moon.
